{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_8_level_st_08-04",
  "groupId": "main_8",
  "stageId": "st_08-04",
  "title": "意志，片縷幻影",
  "storyCode": "M8-4",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_st_08-04.txt",
  "sourceHash": "c173130116f415235c4125908af3ac056dc988928b6eeafedeb00404bcad6d76",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "现在线4"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_topout"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你剛剛說的這些......什麼意思？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“羅德島，我邀請你們一同戰鬥。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是這麼說的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只會說烏薩斯語，你也是用烏薩斯語問我的。你應該聽懂了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們比我們更熟悉切爾諾伯格這些工業機器吧？你們受到的這方面的訓練肯定比我們多。我們更會打仗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你們也要去指揮塔，那你們肯定也安排好了去關掉這玩意的人。不能讓它封閉道路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "遊擊隊必須分兵。如果遊擊隊不把四分之三的力量分出去保護其他地方的感染者，那他們會被殺死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "塔露拉手下的整合運動已經陷入瘋癲，發生在切爾諾伯格的報復事件已經夠多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然剩下四分之一的遊擊隊已經能夠打掉塔露拉那些蠢笨的衛隊，但......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......在這時候，多一個幫手，就能多搶佔一些勝機。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "源石祭壇已經失效。我們的魔族佬也不錯，但大尉那種精怪傳說裡一般的神力，他們還是做不到的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們需要更多火力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誰能點頭同意，或是搖頭否定？你們的領袖就是那隻卡特斯嗎？還是那隻菲林？你們同樣有力，都能承擔大任。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "問阿米婭。我只是羅德島的幹員。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "卡特斯，你同意嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先生，如果你所代表的整合運動，依然是個以主張救助感染者為第一優先目標的組織，"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而不是代表著烏薩斯某種國家政治力量的感染者團體......我們於公於私都會同意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是......我害怕......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "害怕什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "整合運動與我們之間的矛盾和既有暴力事件的創傷，在這一時半刻是無法抹平的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們可以擺出一副願意原諒罪行或者乞求寬恕的態度，但那是對真正受害者的不尊重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "尤其是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們整合運動殺害了我的朋友。我們剛剛殺死了你們尊敬的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（輕哼）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我能明白......我殺了你們的家人，對不對？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這不可能原諒的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但你們是感染者！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果我方有感染者不同意你們的加入，那就是違抗命令。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在的命令，是摧毀塔露拉和她麾下的惡棍。違抗命令的，都會被處決。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你想放下？你能......放下？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，你殺了我們的親人。你殺了我們的指揮官，我們的領袖和榜樣，我們的大尉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我們不會因為你這麼做了就動手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們不想報仇嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然想。別逼我一遍又一遍地解釋，菲林！聽我說完。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，在更高尚的目標之前，我們個人的仇恨不值一提。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有更值得我們去恨的東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "恨......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "菲林，你知道的吧？你身邊這隻卡特斯，就像大尉說的那樣，還是個充滿幻想的孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不准這麼說阿米婭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈，你相信她那套教化別人的傲慢想法，那就照她說的去做！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你會被人背叛，到死也不自知，你也救不了身邊的人。看起來高尚，實際上不管用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而我們，我們相信大尉，他一路走來，向我們展示了一條不同以往烏薩斯無數爭鬥的道路......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一條高尚的復仇與毀滅之路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "毀滅之路？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "毀滅敵人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "認清你的敵人，然後毀滅他們！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是，可是，誰是敵人？散播恨意，一味施暴，引起的戰爭，被捲入的悲劇，這難道好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這沒讓你們失去自己的朋友和戰友嗎？烏薩斯不也......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先皇許諾過，總有一天這場戰爭會結束！而我們也篤信他偉大的願景。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你做的那些才讓我看不到頭。講道理？他們不講道理。有的人就是混帳，有的惡棍就是該殺！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "菲林，聽著！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斬殺仇敵不會讓你痛快，原因很簡單，因為這事兒還沒完。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要做就做到底，要殺就殺乾淨，把這個國家裡的齷齪事情一掃而空，看著白茫茫一片的雪原......這時候你才會高興！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想想吧，我們去把他們殺了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "把那個指揮塔上害死我們多少同胞的陰謀家殺了，把各個城市作威作福的統治者殺了，把各個軍團的廢物和叛徒全都殺了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最後再把現在皇帝身邊那些用花言巧語禍害烏薩斯的群臣，全都殺了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "回頭看看，再回頭看看！你會看到那些該活著的人都活下來了，他們安居樂業，再也不用為誰送命為誰挨餓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你也是在這樣做的，對不對？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誰害死你的朋友，你就殺掉誰！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們想直接殺死塔露拉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那當然！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不然呢？不殺她，大尉能安息嗎？我們對得起葉蓮娜小姐和她的雪怪嗎，我們無數的整合運動兄弟們就這麼被她慫恿著送了命嗎？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等一個聖人，等一個好皇帝，等一個英雄......我們厭倦了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等到了又怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "偉大的皇帝隕落了，他最寶貴的遺產無人繼承，所有人都在為了那些微不足道的利益勾心鬥角，撕裂這個國家，擠壓他的人民！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聖人被活埋了，英雄剛才就已經死在我們面前了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這哪裡是你們能理解的事情？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但你們有能理解的。菲林，你失去過親人嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的眼神已經把答案告訴我了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不想和你說話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但你會聽的，菲林。你有著戰士的眼神。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_topout"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_016",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "封閉層還在上升......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這東西沒停下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要調諧源石傳動需要不少時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你們最好快點。這門如果闔上，那烏薩斯公義的大門，可能是又要等上幾百年才能再開啟了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "遊擊隊不只是在為了感染者而戰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然不只是！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "感染者只是個理由。想要的話，多少都有！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們走上雪原只有一個原因，那就是烏薩斯破壞了公平和秩序。大尉說了，感染者原本不必這樣子，這只是現在烏薩斯的手段！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想像一下，一場大遠征......大尉帶我們走到這裡，怎麼會只是為了感染者？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們從邊疆來到邊疆，繞過堅固的要塞城市，奪下帝國命脈的控制權，聯合各種力量，長驅直入，刺向腐朽帝國的心臟......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "卡特斯，你難道沒想過嗎？你可不只是因為變成感染者才變成這樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果他們公平地對待所有人，你可能不用變成感染者的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想想看，那些端坐城市的市民和貴族，商人和唱歌跳舞的，有幾個人感染了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而在荒原上，在城市周圍和礦場裡，又有多少人感染了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個仇，必須得報！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "向誰報復？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所有擋在這條正道前面的人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不對......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米婭......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你難道不恨那些把我們變成這樣的人嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不是在說感染者遭遇的不公這件事！我是說，將這變成一種宣洩的手段，這很......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們為了自己，讓我們變成這樣......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那些把我們變成怪物的人！我......我也恨他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對不對，菲林？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不是的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......對不起。\n這會很痛。\n對不起......阿米婭。這不該發生在你身上的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......阿米婭，你為什麼......為什麼會這麼說？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難道他們不可恨嗎？難道他們沒有搶走你的生活嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不想忘記那些事情......我不想忘記我的朋友和家人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我原本可以穿自己喜歡的衣服，去自己想去的學校，我想知道我的爸爸媽媽是什麼樣，我的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的......兄弟......嗚......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "迷迭香，別急......別急！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不管......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不管。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米婭說的這些，只有這些......我不管！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是我受傷就能讓他們不受傷，要是我受苦可以讓他們不受苦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就，那就讓我來吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是殺了他們，殺了那些毀掉我們生活的人能讓你們都更好受一些的話，阿米婭，你不願意做的話，就讓我來吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "迷迭香，阿米婭，來自工程小隊的通訊......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香小隊成員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們受到了奇怪的干擾，傳動結構卡住不動了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香小隊成員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......敵人？隊長聽到請回話，這裡是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香小隊成員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不對，不對！他們是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香小隊成員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "隊長！當心烏——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "退開！跳下去，快！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼了？快回話......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......快回話呀！拉瓦卡！碧銀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，不不不......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "封閉層還在上升！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（工程小組......遇伏了？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不對，不對，碧銀，碧銀她，我摸不到她了，我勾不著她了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......準備爆炸物。把這裡全部炸掉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "炸毀摧毀封閉層意味著這附近的數條街道也不能倖免，還有躲藏著的不合作感染者在！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有時間了。再磨蹭下去只會死更多人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "通訊徹底斷線了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你不同意就拿出更好的方案來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "不行。\n絕對不行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們說的我都......我不知道。但是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的小隊......我的小隊成員......我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們已經做得很好了，他們為什麼會遇到這種事！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是需要力氣，需要摧毀什麼的話，我來不就好了嗎！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "迷迭香！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......啊......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "迷迭香！蜷起手指！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要......撕開......毀掉不就......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什......封閉層被強行停住了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不就好了！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_016",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爆炸？！不，不，那個菲林，她......那是用什麼東西撕扯了地塊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_016",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......什麼......什麼東西......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_016",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "簡直，簡直是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島近衛幹員？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_059",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "噓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島近衛幹員？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_059",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（搖頭）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島近衛幹員？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_059",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們第一次見霜星與塔露拉，難道不也是這樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島近衛幹員？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_059",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等你我身上的感染症狀再嚴重點......說不定還會見到更多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼，呼......我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米婭......我......有些冷......頭好......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "迷迭香！我抓住你了，我抓住你了......別鬆開，你也要抓緊......抓緊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她一個人摧毀了封閉層？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然支撐不了多久......但應該夠我們通過整片區域了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "醫療幹員！快來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，呃呃......嗚......！在抓我，在抓我，在抓我......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "負面情感和直接作用性法術導致的副作用......全是和碧銀相關的記憶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "迷迭香......看我這裡，看我的眼睛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（黑色的線條從魔王的手指流進了菲林的眼睛......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（她的確是......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗚，嗚......我知道......知道的......阿米婭......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不可以再這麼做......！但，但就算我這樣說了你也......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......對，對不起......我不會改的。嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "做得好，菲林。做得非常好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "兄弟們，我們向前走！頂著炮火和弩箭，我們前進！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們就現在這裡歇一會兒吧，羅德島。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能暫且等一下嗎，遊擊隊的戰士？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們相互之間沒有通訊方式。即使是你身邊那位前羅德島雇員，他的通訊設備也沒有我們這一次行動的權限。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果盾衛真的需要我們配合......那麼至少應該瞭解一下羅德島會怎樣去做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好。等上一會兒也無妨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "畢竟這隻小菲林幫了我們大忙了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（微弱地喘氣）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "迷迭香......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不會有事的。我還要......繼續......戰鬥呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "得......去......找我的工程小組。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......好，我知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "又是，陳長官的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_outcounty"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "char_222_bpipe",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你是一定會回去囉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "肯定的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "char_222_bpipe",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可你也說了，現在你這個朋友在烏薩斯生死不明，你回去龍門也沒什麼用吧。唔，畢業以後直接去烏薩斯......可能嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "烏薩斯是不會開入境准證給我這種人的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "char_222_bpipe",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不會吧......唉，但真的好可惜，你居然讀完就走。陳陳頭腦那麼好，進修個高級講師不成問題的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "char_222_bpipe",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "過兩年資歷就上去了呀，這在哪個國家都會很吃香吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別再那麼叫我了，求你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "char_222_bpipe",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我？我頭腦怎麼樣你也知道。不笨是肯定的，但是你說聰明吧......我聯合作戰課每次都只是剛好及格。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "剛考完的那門軍事戰略？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "char_222_bpipe",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "每次都差點沒及格。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行了，你已經比維多利亞百分之九十八的人都有頭腦了。至少紙面上是這樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "char_222_bpipe",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但講師我肯定是不指望啦。再說，比起一上來就去搞指揮搞技術的軍官，我還是覺得，得從士兵一步步做起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你真是不怕死。誰知道維多利亞的士兵會在戰場上遇到什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "char_222_bpipe",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可敵人也不想在戰場上遇到維多利亞的士兵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "char_222_bpipe",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我怕在戰略地圖前面坐太久，會慢慢把人命看成數字。很可怕。前線和各個駐地的士兵需要有人去告訴他們什麼該做，什麼不該做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "char_222_bpipe",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只有親身上了戰場，才會知道戰鬥有多殘忍，戰爭有多不該發生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你還真想改變維多利亞？我以為......以為那是你酒後瞎說的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "char_222_bpipe",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒，沒啊。有那麼奇怪嗎？！我就......就只是想做點好事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好事不易。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我回龍門也是差不多的原因。我不想龍門再發生更多壞事。待在龍門，解決壞事，阻止壞事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "char_222_bpipe",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你是要回去當警察？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "警察？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "char_222_bpipe",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇。我一直覺得陳陳你看上去就是那種，會狠狠地揍歹徒一頓的人。我沒看錯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別下結論。但警察......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "警察也不壞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "警察應該也會手握更多線索吧，當年的事，現在的事......不用再靠我那個一臉老謀深算樣的舅舅了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "char_222_bpipe",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我以前都有點害怕，怕你會去選軍事情報科，陳陳這麼陰森森的，成了間諜肯定特別可怕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*維多利亞問候用語*"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "char_222_bpipe",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......！我是不會講粗話的。哎，我忍得住！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈。看你能忍到什麼時候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "char_222_bpipe",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，有人敲門。稍等！來啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "學院信使",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "給陳暉潔小姐的電訊，已經完成了轉錄，請您檢查下終端。為了確保這條資訊是您自己閱讀的，我需要當面確認。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼東西這麼大費周章？等我看下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你說什麼？這......什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "學院信使",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看來您已經收到訊息了。學院沒有對高保密內容進行例行檢查的權力，如果需要對內容進行進一步的諮詢，我推薦您直接回件。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "學院信使",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還需要我做些什麼？沒有的話，就此告辭。祝兩位度過一個美好的下午。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "char_222_bpipe",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "char_222_bpipe",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......為什麼要在走廊上走正步啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "char_222_bpipe",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你臉色很奇怪。就像你剛收到的資訊給了你一拳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也不知道該怎麼形容自己的心情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們知道我朋友的行蹤了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "char_222_bpipe",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那不是好事嗎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "得到她的蹤跡這件事......也是她又一次失蹤的開始。她......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她......殺了當時擄走她的那個人。在這之後又一次......下落不明。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "char_222_bpipe",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "char_222_bpipe",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那最少——最少她還活著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說得對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......畢業後我會立刻回龍門。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "char_222_bpipe",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？不是......不是，她不是在烏薩斯嗎？我以為你一定要去烏薩斯了，還在想要不要畢業前幫你織幾條圍巾做餞別禮呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在烏薩斯不可能伸得開手腳，但在龍門，我會逐漸擴大自己的優勢。龍門的力量在城市間肯定比我一個人的力量強。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我會找到她的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“淚鋒之招，當斷即斷。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
